% expect-error: typecheck
% oracle: skip the reference interpreter aborts on an operator code outside the table instead of raising typecheck
% Scenario: an operator code outside the table (12 to 32) is typecheck.
[ [0 0 10 10 5 5] <00 01 0c> ] ufill
